WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:02.068
-Welcome, everybody.

00:00:02.068 --> 00:00:04.504
Welcome, welcome to
"The Tonight Show"!

00:00:04.504 --> 00:00:08.207
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:08.207 --> 00:00:09.409
This is exciting.

00:00:09.409 --> 00:00:12.245
Michelle Obama
is on the show tonight!

00:00:12.245 --> 00:00:14.614
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:14.614 --> 00:00:17.016
Yep, she'll be talking about
eating healthy

00:00:17.016 --> 00:00:18.752
while I work through
last night's

00:00:18.752 --> 00:00:21.954
double corned-beef sandwich
on rye.

00:00:21.954 --> 00:00:23.189
Let's get to the news.

00:00:23.189 --> 00:00:24.724
Well, guys, the drama between

00:00:24.724 --> 00:00:27.594
President Biden and
Vladimir Putin continues.

00:00:27.594 --> 00:00:29.796 line:0%
A day after Biden called
Putin a killer,

00:00:29.796 --> 00:00:34.166 line:0%
Putin responded by saying,
"It takes one to know one."

00:00:34.166 --> 00:00:37.136
-Sheesh!
-This is fun.

00:00:37.136 --> 00:00:38.704
As if the pandemic
wasn't enough,

00:00:38.704 --> 00:00:41.540
let's throw in tension with
a "nuclear enemy" into the mix.

00:00:41.540 --> 00:00:43.109
Why not?

00:00:43.109 --> 00:00:45.477
Don't worry.
Biden isn't scared by this.

00:00:45.477 --> 00:00:47.547
Just to be safe, he skipped
wearing underwear today

00:00:47.547 --> 00:00:50.683
just in case they were poisoned.

00:00:50.683 --> 00:00:52.152
Yep, these guys
are really going at it.

00:00:52.152 --> 00:00:53.853
But keep in mind,
it could also be just

00:00:53.853 --> 00:00:55.588
a marketing stunt for
Sunglass Hut.

00:00:55.588 --> 00:01:00.993
Just saying.
Just think about it.

00:01:00.993 --> 00:01:03.729
The Kremlin also weighed in
and called Biden's comments

00:01:03.729 --> 00:01:06.265
about Putin "very bad"
and demanded

00:01:06.265 --> 00:01:09.035
an explanation or an apology.

00:01:09.035 --> 00:01:11.671
Then Biden was like,
"Well, which one do you want?

00:01:11.671 --> 00:01:14.340
Explanation or apology?"

00:01:18.177 --> 00:01:21.113
Yep, the Kremlin demanded that
Biden explain himself,

00:01:21.113 --> 00:01:22.648
which will backfire
when they realize

00:01:22.648 --> 00:01:25.451
every Biden explanation
takes at least three hours.

00:01:25.451 --> 00:01:28.788
"I know a Russian guy
named Igor.

00:01:30.657 --> 00:01:33.459
We used to call him Scooter

00:01:33.459 --> 00:01:38.998
'cause he had a bicycle
with no pedals.

00:01:38.998 --> 00:01:43.035
He would scoot
his way to school."

00:01:43.035 --> 00:01:45.305 line:0%
Wow! But things didn't
stop there,

00:01:45.305 --> 00:01:48.207 line:0%
because later today,
Putin invited Biden to have

00:01:48.207 --> 00:01:52.479 line:0%
a public live-streamed chat
either tomorrow or Monday.

00:01:52.479 --> 00:01:55.515 line:0%
Somehow, we went from, "It takes
a killer to know a killer" to

00:01:55.515 --> 00:01:58.351 line:0%
"You free for
Zoom happy hour later?

00:01:58.351 --> 00:02:02.222
Just saying, it could be fun.
Just a couple palsies."

00:02:02.222 --> 00:02:03.655
Yep, it's a busy time for Biden.

00:02:03.655 --> 00:02:05.258
Today, his
administration announced

00:02:05.258 --> 00:02:08.694
that they are sending millions
of AstraZeneca vaccine doses

00:02:08.694 --> 00:02:10.697
to Canada and Mexico.

00:02:10.697 --> 00:02:11.930
That's nice.

00:02:11.930 --> 00:02:13.299
We're giving them
the one vaccine

00:02:13.299 --> 00:02:16.335
that isn't approved in the U.S.

00:02:16.335 --> 00:02:18.270
It's like telling a houseguest,
"Hey, if you're hungry,

00:02:18.270 --> 00:02:21.406
there's a frozen Lean Cuisine
from 1989 in the garage.

00:02:21.406 --> 00:02:24.677
Don't touch our food.

00:02:24.677 --> 00:02:27.646
Go at it.
Go at it with that lasagna."

00:02:27.646 --> 00:02:30.049
Here's some more big news
out of our nation's capital.

00:02:30.049 --> 00:02:32.285
As of this week, magic mushrooms

00:02:32.285 --> 00:02:35.221
are now decriminalized
in Washington, D.C.

00:02:35.221 --> 00:02:38.358
-What?!
[ Laughter ]

00:02:43.262 --> 00:02:46.266
-You can already see a
difference with some lawmakers.

00:02:46.266 --> 00:02:47.467
Take a look at how
they were behaving

00:02:47.467 --> 00:02:49.068
before and after
the 'shrooms kicked in.

00:02:49.068 --> 00:02:50.068
Watch this.

00:02:50.068 --> 00:02:54.206 line:0%
-Let's pass this bill!

00:02:54.206 --> 00:02:57.242 line:0%
The brain is an amazing organ.

00:02:57.242 --> 00:03:01.280 line:0%
-How critical it is that we do
something about COVID.

00:03:01.280 --> 00:03:05.184 line:0%
Go smoke some dope and you will
enjoy life so much more.

00:03:05.184 --> 00:03:08.922 line:0%
-Fear has become an
all-too-prevalent quality.

00:03:08.922 --> 00:03:10.689 line:0%
This is, of course, a picture of

00:03:10.689 --> 00:03:12.858 line:0%
former president Ronald Reagan.

00:03:12.858 --> 00:03:15.261 line:0%
And actually firing
a machine gun

00:03:15.261 --> 00:03:17.497 line:0%
while riding on the back
of a dinosaur.

00:03:19.598 --> 00:03:24.303
-Wait. That's real?

00:03:24.303 --> 00:03:27.073
What?!
-Some sports news.

00:03:27.073 --> 00:03:28.440
Well, everyone is
pumped for this.

00:03:28.440 --> 00:03:31.010
It is March Madness!
That's right.

00:03:31.010 --> 00:03:32.878
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:03:32.878 --> 00:03:35.181
Everyone is doing
their office pools.

00:03:35.181 --> 00:03:36.616
Of course, this year, that means

00:03:36.616 --> 00:03:40.920
it's you against your wife,
your 2-year-old, and your dog.

00:03:40.920 --> 00:03:43.456
"Rusty, you picked
Gonzaga, too?"

00:03:44.990 --> 00:03:47.026
And this is cool -- fans will be
allowed in the arenas,

00:03:47.026 --> 00:03:48.561
but capacity will be limited.

00:03:48.561 --> 00:03:50.630
So to add some extra excitement,

00:03:50.630 --> 00:03:53.999
CBS is making the
sneaker squeaks 50% louder.

00:03:53.999 --> 00:03:55.068
[ Sneakers squeaking ]

00:03:55.068 --> 00:03:57.803
"And there's pass from Jennings.

00:03:57.803 --> 00:04:00.039
Oh, he's got the easy lay-up.

00:04:00.039 --> 00:04:01.574
Jennings has got
the easy lay-up!

00:04:01.574 --> 00:04:04.010
Oh, rejected out of the..."

00:04:04.010 --> 00:04:07.579
[ Squeaking stops ]
-Wait.

00:04:07.579 --> 00:04:08.647
[ Sneakers squeaking ]

00:04:08.647 --> 00:04:11.183
"There is a pass over to
Okanuba.

00:04:11.183 --> 00:04:12.651
Okanuba passes
back to Jennings!

00:04:12.651 --> 00:04:14.019
He's down in the paint
and he's..."

00:04:14.019 --> 00:04:16.521
[ Squeaking stops ]

00:04:16.521 --> 00:04:17.790
[ Sneakers squeaking ]

00:04:17.790 --> 00:04:18.858
No, don't play it -- I can't.
I'm out of breath.

00:04:18.858 --> 00:04:21.927
-Please, please.

00:04:21.927 --> 00:04:22.995
-Well, this is great, though.

00:04:22.995 --> 00:04:24.764
Do you guys remember
Sister Jean?

00:04:24.764 --> 00:04:27.600
She was the nun who was
the biggest fan of

00:04:27.600 --> 00:04:28.935
Loyola Chicago
basketball team?

00:04:28.935 --> 00:04:30.036
-Oh, yeah.
-Yeah.

00:04:30.036 --> 00:04:32.371
Well, her school is back
in the tournament,

00:04:32.371 --> 00:04:36.041
and at 101 years old, she's been
cleared to attend the game.

00:04:36.041 --> 00:04:39.745
[ Cheers and applause ]
Yeah.

00:04:39.745 --> 00:04:40.913
I love Sister Jean.

00:04:40.913 --> 00:04:42.915
She's Loyola's most beloved fan

00:04:42.915 --> 00:04:46.386
and their most
unforgiving bookie.

00:04:46.386 --> 00:04:51.090
You thought a ruler was bad.
She walks around with a pipe.

00:04:51.090 --> 00:04:54.160
"Contributions
a little light this week."

00:04:56.895 --> 00:04:58.931
When asked how it felt to be
allowed to attend,

00:04:58.931 --> 00:05:03.436
Sister Jean said
she was "#Blessed."

00:05:03.436 --> 00:05:05.571
[ Laughter ]

00:05:05.571 --> 00:05:08.541
Sister Jean, yeah.

00:05:08.541 --> 00:05:09.775
The team loves Sister Jean.

00:05:09.775 --> 00:05:11.243
Before tip-off, she always has

00:05:11.243 --> 00:05:13.011
the same uplifting message --

00:05:13.011 --> 00:05:15.414
"Have fun out there and don't be
afraid to stuff a fool,

00:05:15.414 --> 00:05:17.150
you freshman bitch."

00:05:17.150 --> 00:05:19.018
What?

00:05:19.018 --> 00:05:21.120
That's just...

00:05:21.120 --> 00:05:22.455
And, finally,
this is pretty wild.

00:05:22.455 --> 00:05:24.056
A man in New York was
just convicted

00:05:24.056 --> 00:05:25.258
of a very unusual crime.

00:05:25.258 --> 00:05:26.559
Watch this.

00:05:26.559 --> 00:05:29.328 line:0%
-A man in New York was convicted
of illegal trafficking

00:05:29.328 --> 00:05:32.498 line:0%
after keeping live sharks
in a pool at his home

00:05:32.498 --> 00:05:34.933 line:0%
and offering them for sale
on the Internet.

00:05:34.933 --> 00:05:39.205
-Even the sharks were like,
"Ugh, an aboveground pool?"

00:05:41.840 --> 00:05:43.843
Right now, Vladimir Putin is
trying to set up the meeting

00:05:43.843 --> 00:05:45.444
with Biden directly
over that tank.

00:05:45.444 --> 00:05:47.747
[ Russian accent ]
Just take two more steps closer.

00:05:47.747 --> 00:05:49.748
The Wi-Fi is better there."

00:05:49.748 --> 00:05:50.750
[ Buzzer ]
Alright.

